--[[
	ClassicUI v2.0 - Fully Featured Classic Roblox UI Library
	Author: ScriptMirrorOffical
	Description: A complete, classic-styled GUI framework for Roblox executors.
	Features:
	- Classic 2010s Roblox aesthetic (grays, blue accents, bevels, shadows)
	- Draggable windows with tabs
	- Toggles, buttons, sliders, dropdowns, labels, textboxes
	- Keybind selector with rebinding
	- Color picker with RGB sliders and hex input
